    "body": "Hmm, I'm confused by your description of Chrome's current behavior.  Since very early on, Chrome has tracked SiteInstance / BrowsingInstance on NavigationEntry, so the session history does know what browsing context group each joint session history item belongs to.  We use this restore documents to their previous groups as the user goes back/forward.  Am I misunderstanding the case you're describing?",
