    "body": "Hi Jake! While I believe this to be a chrome implementation detail (I don't think error pages are spec'd?), that's correct that we have had conflicting requirements with error pages and COOP. The stand at the moment was to disable COOP on them (https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/3024337). It's a good starting point, since it links to several real bugs we encountered.\r\n\r\nSo the answer is, we're not 100% confident that this is the right decision but that's our take on it for now. @antosart for the reference.",
